"""Render the collected measurements as a self-contained comparison, with missing outcomes kept explicit."""
import json,pathlib,sys
r=json.load(open(sys.argv[1]));out=pathlib.Path(sys.argv[2])
page='''<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Warped forest pearl measurements</title><style>
body{font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui);line-height:1.45;color:var(--foreground)}h2{font-size:18px;margin:24px 0 10px}p{margin:8px 0}.muted,small{color:var(--muted-foreground)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:10px}.box{padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius,10px);background:var(--card)}.big{font-size:25px;font-weight:650;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.bar{height:8px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--chart-1);margin:5px 0 12px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px}th,td{text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:9px 4px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}td:first-child{font-family:var(--font-mono,monospace)}.note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted-foreground)}.status{color:var(--warning-foreground)}svg{width:100%;height:175px}svg text{font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui);fill:var(--muted-foreground);font-size:11px}.scroll{overflow-x:auto}
</style></head><body><div class="grid"><div class="box"><small>Forests prepared</small><div class="big" id="forests"></div><p class="note">Natural nylium starts, v2 iron kit. Operator-only locate; route travel unmeasured.</p></div><div class="box"><small>Formal scripted trials</small><div class="big" id="physical-count"></div><p class="note">Three repeats per forest, 20 game minutes each. Calibrations are excluded.</p></div><div class="box"><small>Valid Sol games</small><div class="big" id="game-count"></div><p class="note">Sol low/default, 60-minute budgets. At least three required; every launch needs a fresh answer within 30 seconds.</p></div></div>
<h2>Portal to warped forest</h2><div class="box" id="distances"></div><p class="note">Horizontal distance to the prepared natural standing point. Vertical changes and terrain still matter. These four seeds do not establish a distribution across Minecraft seeds.</p>
<h2>The chosen tactic</h2><div class="box"><svg viewBox="0 0 480 175" role="img" aria-label="Three-by-three ceiling with two blocks of space for a player, excluding the taller enderman"><path d="M20 150H460" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="5"/><path d="M130 82.5H220" stroke="var(--chart-2)" stroke-width="15"/><rect x="166" y="96" width="18" height="54" rx="4" fill="var(--chart-1)"/><rect x="255" y="80" width="18" height="70" rx="3" fill="var(--foreground)"/><circle cx="264" cy="70" r="10" fill="var(--foreground)"/><path d="M195 121H250" stroke="var(--chart-1)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/><text x="90" y="50">3×3 ceiling; two blocks above feet</text><text x="108" y="169">Stand under its centre</text><text x="290" y="92">3-block-tall</text><text x="290" y="107">enderman</text></svg><p class="note">Illustration of the tactic, not a captured game frame. The model chooses cover, target and timing. Provoke one, look down, fight from cover and collect the drop. Gaze protection uses priority 9; movement stays at 8 or below.</p></div>
<h2>Pearls in a 20-minute opportunity</h2><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Seed</th><th>Repeats</th><th>Retained, mean</th><th>Picked up, mean</th><th>Deaths</th></tr></thead><tbody id="physical"></tbody></table></div><p class="note">A death ends an attempt and leaves zero retained pearls. No extrapolation from surviving minutes. A missing or failed harness attempt is not a zero-pearl result.</p>
<h2>Real Sol games</h2><div id="games" class="grid"></div><p class="note">Minutes per retained pearl = the full 60-minute budget divided by final holdings. A game with a 10-minute provider stall is void, including if the provider later recovers. Body execution time and provider waiting are separated.</p><p id="probes" class="note"></p><p class="note">Gold remains secondary: mine seen ore along travel and barter held ingots. The earlier gold experiment established no improvement: normal decisions scored 8/66 in both arms; both completed gold-route games ended with zero pearls.</p>
<script>const D=__DATA__;const el=id=>document.getElementById(id);const fmt=n=>n==null?'not measured':Number(n).toFixed(2).replace(/\\.?0+$/,'');const valid=D.games.filter(g=>g.valid);el('forests').textContent=`${D.survey.length}/4`;el('physical-count').textContent=`${D.physicalGroups.reduce((n,g)=>n+g.n,0)}/12`;el('game-count').textContent=`${valid.length}/3 minimum`;
const max=Math.max(1,...D.survey.map(s=>s.horizontalDistance));el('distances').innerHTML=D.survey.map(s=>`<div class="row"><span>${s.seed}</span><b>${Math.round(s.horizontalDistance)} m · dy ${s.position[1]-s.portal[1]}</b></div><div class="bar" style="width:${100*s.horizontalDistance/max}%"></div>`).join('');el('physical').innerHTML=D.physicalGroups.map(g=>`<tr><td>${g.seed}</td><td>${g.n}/3</td><td>${fmt(g.pearlsRetainedPer20MinuteOpportunity)}</td><td>${fmt(g.pearlsPickedUpPer20MinuteOpportunity)}</td><td>${g.n?g.deaths:'—'}</td></tr>`).join('');
el('games').innerHTML=D.games.length?D.games.map(g=>`<div class="box"><b>${g.seed}</b><p class="${g.valid?'':'status'}">${g.valid?'Complete':g.voidByProviderStall?'Void: provider stall':'Unavailable / incomplete'}</p><div class="big">${g.valid?g.pearlsHeld:'—'} pearls retained</div><p>Kills ${g.valid?g.endermenKilled:'—'} · deaths ${g.valid?g.deaths:'—'}</p><p class="note">${g.valid&&g.minutesPerRetainedPearl!=null?fmt(g.minutesPerRetainedPearl)+' min per retained pearl':'No finite retained-pearl rate'}</p></div>`).join(''):'<p class="muted">No completed Sol game is available yet.</p>';el('probes').textContent=`Short readiness probes passed: ${D.probes.filter(p=>p.passed).length}/${D.probes.length}. Probe failures are not game outcomes.`;
console.log(JSON.stringify({forests:D.survey.length,physicalRepeats:D.physicalGroups.reduce((n,g)=>n+g.n,0),validGames:valid.length}));</script></body></html>'''
out.write_text(page.replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(r,separators=(',',':')).replace('<','\\u003c')));print(out)
